    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches Estate Agents are delighted to present this three-bedroom end-of-terrace home, ideally positioned in a well-established residential setting and offering an excellent opportunity for those seeking a property with genuine potential to create a substantial and highly individual home.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 89 sq. m., the property offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising an entrance hall, living accommodation, kitchen, three bedrooms and one bathroom. While the property would benefit from modernisation and refurbishment, it provides an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to put their own stamp on the home, with scope to update and potentially reconfigure the accommodation to suit contemporary living, subject to the necessary planning permissions and building regulations.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of the property is the exceptionally generous garden space to the front and side. Being an end-of-terrace property, it enjoys a substantial plot with an unusually large front garden extending around the side of the house, providing an excellent sense of space and a rare amount of outdoor space for a property of this type. The property also benefits from a large driveway to the front, providing generous off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, with Deansgrange Village close by offering a range of shops, cafés, supermarkets and everyday amenities, while Blackrock, Dun Laoghaire and Monkstown are also within easy reach. The area is well served by a selection of highly regarded schools including Clonkeen College, Hollypark, Newpark Comprehensive, CBC Monkstown and Blackrock College, while transport links are excellent with easy access to the N11 and M50, regular bus services and DART stations at Blackrock and Dun Laoghaire.\r\n\r\nThe property offers an excellent opportunity for a purchaser looking to modernise and put their own stamp on a three-bedroom end-of-terrace home. With its exceptionally generous site, substantial front and side gardens and large driveway, the property offers excellent potential to create a wonderful home in a highly sought-after South Dublin location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E"
      }
